            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapline 1.7.1</h2>
<p>The first release delivered through Snapline's own updater.</p>
<p>Nothing else changes in this version. It exists to put the update
mechanism in place: from here on, Snapline checks for new versions in the
background and offers them in this dialog, replacing itself in place — so
you never have to download and reinstall by hand again.</p>
]]></description>
